      <definition>[= dang, 3 + cu] adv. Too much</definition>
      <page>230</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠠᠩᠴᠣ ᠳᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- da!</transcript>
          <definition> How could that be!. What do you mean?. (expressing astonishment).</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠠᠩᠴᠣ ᠮᠠᠭᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- maγu</transcript>
          <definition> Too bad, extremely bad.</definition>
